Test Case: scaling_proximity_placement_group_removed
================================================================================

Initial Error:
Error: Missing required argument
  on azapi.tf line 1, in module "replicator":
   1: module "replicator" {
The argument "resource_group_id" is required, but no definition was found.

Fix Process:

Attempt 1:
- Problem Analysis: The azapi.tf file was using `resource_group_name` instead of the required `resource_group_id` parameter. The module expects the full resource group ID, not just the name.
- Fix Method: Changed `resource_group_name = azurerm_resource_group.test.name` to `resource_group_id = azurerm_resource_group.test.id`
- Changes Made: Modified line 5 in azapi.tf to use resource_group_id with the ID value
- Result: Still failed - module also requires resource_group_name

Attempt 2:
- Problem Analysis: The module requires BOTH resource_group_id and resource_group_name parameters
- Fix Method: Added resource_group_name back alongside resource_group_id
- Changes Made: Added both resource_group_id and resource_group_name to the module call
- Result: Success - plan shows acceptable drifts only

Final Result: Fix successful

